  "notes": [
    "E31 is a NOT_FOUND secondary card, projected as TO_VERIFY with permit_class NULL and excluded from Guide paths.",
    "Relationship options follow official titles and special requirements. E31F names the court-established legal parent-child relationship; it does not invent an adoption, age or marital-status rule. E31C/F applicability can overlap and remains TO_VERIFY; a generic child-of-WNI answer does not select a code.",
    "E31D is the foreign stepchild in a lawful foreign/Indonesian marriage; its application request and family-register checklist name the Indonesian parent. The foreign-parent title is not a foreign-sponsor entitlement.",
    "Only E31E and E31H expressly prohibit joining a Golden Visa holder as a Family Dependant. Their gate is not extended to other codes by inference.",
    "Sponsor means the sponsor or family support stated in the selected Law card. Documentary evidence is a result checklist, never a question.",
    "All nine substantive pages state 1 or 2 YEAR initial stays and extensions without a cumulative maximum. Months compare at exactly 12 per YEAR; above 24 months returns OK_WITH_EXTENSION with total_max_known false.",
    "Spouse price descriptions explicitly cover Indonesian-citizen and ITAS/ITAP-holder spouses (E31A/B). Dependent descriptions cover family of ITAS/ITAP holders (E31E/H/J). These are exact catalog references, not a choice of application channel or duration-specific quote.",
    "Born KITAS and Dependent KITAP + MERP mappings remain TO_VERIFY; no price or is_sold value is inferred for them.",
    "E31B title versus WNI-spouse application-letter wording, E31A PNBP component mismatch, and E31A/B/C GCI direct-ITAP versus visa-page ITAS context remain TO_VERIFY. Cards are unchanged.",
    "Offshore/onshore application location, cumulative extension maxima and per-code ITAS-to-ITAP conversion remain null + TO_VERIFY. The family-category conversion text and direct GCI context in ITAP.json establish no per-code conversion; DB itap stays NULL for every code.",
    "OWNER RULING 2026-10-19 (commercial, not Law): E31C, E31D, E31F and E31G are sold under the six exact kitas_permits Dependent keys (1 Year / 2 Years x Altus/Onshore, Offshore, Extend); is_sold true. This supersedes the earlier unpriced ruling (price_keys [], is_sold null). The keys are catalog references, not a choice of channel or a duration-specific quote."
  ]
